/issues/comments/3663261864","html_url":"https://github.com/libgeos/geos/issues/1344#issuecomment-3663261864","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1344","id":3663261864,"node_id":"IC_kwDOACh1KM7aWPCo","user":{"login":"mwtoews","id":895458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NTQ1OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/895458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews","html_url":"https://github.com/mwtoews","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mwtoews/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-17T01:53:25Z","updated_at":"2025-12-17T02:02:47Z","body":"I get the correct result with normalized inputs:\n```\n$ geosop -a \"POLYGON ((-295.25030351249666 4.236074061427525, -295.08711234218333 -2.301948231163383, -314.64218025800653 -2.7900491087570383, -314.80537142831986 3.7479731838338695, -295.25030351249666 4.236074061427525))\" normalize > a.wkt\n$ cat a.wkt\nPOLYGON ((-314.80537142831986 3.7479731838338695, -295.25030351249666 4.236074061427525, -295.08711234218333 -2.301948231163383, -314.64218025800653 -2.7900491087570383, -314.80537142831986 3.7479731838338695))\n$ geosop -a \"POLYGON ((-275.69523559667346 4.7241749390211805, -275.53204442636013 -1.8138473535697273, -295.08711234218333 -2.3019482311633825, -295.25030351249666 4.236074061427525, -275.69523559667346 4.7241749390211805))\" normalize > b.wkt\n$ cat b.wkt\nPOLYGON ((-295.25030351249666 4.236074061427525, -275.69523559667346 4.7241749390211805, -275.53204442636013 -1.8138473535697273, -295.08711234218333 -2.3019482311633825, -295.25030351249666 4.236074061427525))\n$ geosop -a a.wkt -b b.wkt union > ab.wkt\n$ cat ab.wkt\nPOLYGON ((-295.25030351249666 4.236074061427525, -275.69523559667346 4.7241749390211805, -275.53204442636013 -1.8138473535697273, -295.08711234218333 -2.301948231163383, -314.64218025800653 -2.7900491087570383, -314.80537142831986 3.7479731838338695, -295.25030351249666 4.236074061427525))\n$ geosop -a ab.wkt area\n255.86224744045356\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/comments/3663261864/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/comments/3663266406","html_url":"https://github.com/libgeos/geos/issues/1344#issuecomment-3663266406","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1344","id":3663266406,"node_id":"IC_kwDOACh1KM7aWQJm","user":{"login":"pramsey","id":113883,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzg4Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113883?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pramsey","html_url":"https://github.com/pramsey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pramsey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pramsey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pramsey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pramsey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pramsey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pramsey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pramsey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pramsey/events{/privacy}","received_events_ur